# Godot 4 build output and editor caches — ignored.
.godot/
.import/
build/
export.cfg
*.translation
*.tmp
__pycache__/

# Exported packs / binaries
*.pck
*.zip
*.apk
*.aab
*.exe
*.x86_64
*.app
*.dmg

# NOT ignored, deliberately:
#   export_presets.cfg  - carries the include/exclude filters that decide which
#                         fonts and assets reach a build; untracked it makes
#                         builds unreproducible (has already cost us a silently
#                         missing font on another title).
#   *.gd.uid, *.import  - Godot 4 resource UIDs and per-asset import settings.
#                         Dropping them makes script/asset references churn on
#                         every fresh checkout and loses per-asset import params.
